roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3848911010,"text":"どうしたの？","nextNodeIds":[722010104]},{"nodeId":722010104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20423,"speakerName":"レロ","textMapHash":2580949834,"text":"年寄りの嘆きに耳を傾けてくれてありがとう…さあ…こっちへ、話を聞いておくれ…","nextNodeIds":[722010105]},{"nodeId":722010105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20423,"speakerName":"レロ","textMapHash":1299855842,"text":"私は今まで…幸運な日なんて一度もなかった…","nextNodeIds":[722010106]},{"nodeId":722010106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20423,"speakerName":"レロ","textMapHash":1484807210,"text":"私が生まれた時、出産の儀式を執り行った祭司様が灯油を倒し、叔母の長髪をすべて焼き切ってしまった…","nextNodeIds":[722010107]},{"nodeId":722010107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3258546466,"text":"そう…","nextNodeIds":[722010108]},{"nodeId":722010108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20423,"speakerName":"レロ","textMapHash":1879670018,"text":"その後、私は奇妙な病にかかり、四肢が思うように動かなくなった。さらにその後、私はゆりかごから落ちてしまい、肋骨を6本折った…","nextNodeIds":[722010109]},{"nodeId":722010109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20423,"speakerName":"レロ","textMapHash":798952266,"text":"少し大きくなると、ある日叔父がキノコを喉につまらせ、父が助けようとした時にシャベルを私の頭にぶつけた…","nextNodeIds":[722010110]},{"nodeId":722010110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20423,"speakerName":"レロ","textMapHash":2384786282,"text":"またある時は、大事にしていたヤマガラを鵜猿獣に食われ、その鵜猿獣はイノシシにぶつかり崖に落ちた…","nextNodeIds":[722010111]},{"nodeId":722010111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20423,"speakerName":"レロ","textMapHash":2787292970,"text":"その後、好きだった女の子は間違って祭司様を雷鳥様に捧げてしまい、島を追い出された…","nextNodeIds":[722010112]},{"nodeId":722010112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20423,"speakerName":"レロ","textMapHash":2282012346,"text":"成人になると、私が醜いという理由で祖母が亡くなり、すぐに祖父も亡くなった…","nextNodeIds":[722010113]},{"nodeId":722010113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20423,"speakerName":"レロ","textMapHash":812410978,"text":"その後は…","nextNodeIds":[722010114]},{"nodeId":722010114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4178390834,"text":"家族は心の拠り所だったんじゃない？","nextNodeIds":[722010115]},{"nodeId":722010115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20423,"speakerName":"レロ","textMapHash":356995226,"text":"ああ、家族と言えば…成人した時、巫医から私には子供は持てないだろうと言われた。なぜなら、私の体にはあれがあったからだ…少し待て、今見せてやる…","nextNodeIds":[722010116,722010117]},{"nodeId":722010116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3844527970,"text":"嫌だ！","nextNodeIds":[722010118]},{"nodeId":722010118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20423,"speakerName":"レロ","textMapHash":3462392602,"text":"はぁ…もう一つ最後の話を聞いておくれ…この哀れな老人への最後の手伝いとして…","nextNodeIds":[722010119,722010120]},{"nodeId":722010119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1137726642,"text":"どうぞ、話して。","nextNodeIds":[722010121]},{"nodeId":722010121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20423,"speakerName":"レロ","textMapHash":4267442042,"text":"以前、妻を埋葬する際に、金の指輪を墓に落としてしまい、一緒に埋めてしまった…","nextNodeIds":[722010122]},{"nodeId":722010122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20423,"speakerName":"レロ","textMapHash":1316116706,"text":"あれは私の最後の財産だ…しかし私に掘り出す勇気はない…彼女の魂を怒らせてしまう…","nextNodeIds":[722010123]},{"nodeId":722010123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1687427426,"text":"#だから{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BOYFIRST|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_GIRLFIRST]}に墓を掘れと？","nextNodeIds":[722010124]},{"nodeId":722010124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20423,"speakerName":"レロ","textMapHash":3676195514,"text":"君は外の人間だ…何をやっても不思議ではない…","nextNodeIds":[722010125]},{"nodeId":722010125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20423,"speakerName":"レロ","textMapHash":4185144394,"text":"ああ、いや…私が言いたいのは、外の人間なら、現地の魂を怒らせることはないということだ…","nextNodeIds":[722010126]},{"nodeId":722010126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20423,"speakerName":"レロ","textMapHash":1721401042,"text":"チライ社殿に行ってきてくれ…彼女の墓は神祠のそばにある…","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":722010120,"roleType":